WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.702 --> 00:00:08.341
Welcome Flows greet everyone who asks to join your channel or group.

2
00:00:08.471 --> 00:00:12.928
Your own bot welcomes them, lets them in, and follows up later.

3
00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:15.508
The quickest start is a template.

4
00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:18.928
Let's pick "Welcome + 3-day follow-up".

5
00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:23.764
Pick the channel people ask to join, and the bot that sends the welcome.

6
00:00:23.894 --> 00:00:27.968
Castvoo checks that your bot is an admin who can let people in.

7
00:00:28.268 --> 00:00:30.672
Next, choose how people get in.

8
00:00:30.802 --> 00:00:33.201
After the welcome is the default.

9
00:00:33.331 --> 00:00:36.161
They get your message first, then they're let in.

10
00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:39.191
"Straight away" lets everyone in at once.

11
00:00:39.321 --> 00:00:42.291
"When they tap a button" stops most fake accounts.

12
00:00:42.421 --> 00:00:45.865
And with "I decide", requests wait in a list for you.

13
00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:48.536
Keep the "Tap to start" button on.

14
00:00:48.666 --> 00:00:52.979
When people press Start in your bot, your later messages can reach them.

15
00:00:53.279 --> 00:00:55.027
Here is the welcome.

16
00:00:55.157 --> 00:01:01.657
{name} becomes each person's first name, so everyone is greeted personally.

17
00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:04.111
A wait step sets the timer.

18
00:01:04.241 --> 00:01:07.499
This one waits one day before the next message.

19
00:01:07.799 --> 00:01:11.056
Message two reaches people who tapped Start.

20
00:01:11.186 --> 00:01:12.833
Write your tip here.

21
00:01:13.556 --> 00:01:15.576
Add buttons with your links.

22
00:01:15.706 --> 00:01:18.451
Up to six, and every click is tracked.

23
00:01:20.187 --> 00:01:24.564
Use the plus button to add more steps: a message, or a wait.

24
00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:27.682
Save it, then switch it on.

25
00:01:27.812 --> 00:01:31.139
Your bot now welcomes everyone who asks to join.

26
00:01:31.439 --> 00:01:37.928
Later, check the Stats tab to see who was welcomed and let in, and Requests to handle people by hand.
